data: {"id": "7c4cf6ab5188476b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1366", "run_id": "7c4cf6ab5188476b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "kubectl_events", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v (ns: aiops-case-05) 持续处于 FailedCreatePodSandBox 状态。根本原因是 Multus CNI 插件无法找到网络附加定义 'unavailable-network'，导致 Sandbox 创建失败。Pod 已被调度到 node2 但无法启动。\nkey_facts: [\"对象: Pod/workloa", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788428352601, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "entity": {"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v"}, "dimension": "kubernetes"}, "tool_call_id": "call_ea6ded0f76a644ceb6090f6e", "tool_sequence": 3, "semantic_success": true, "result": "Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v (ns: aiops-case-05) 持续处于 FailedCreatePodSandBox 状态。根本原因是 Multus CNI 插件无法找到网络附加定义 'unavailable-network'，导致 Sandbox 创建失败。Pod 已被调度到 node2 但无法启动。\nkey_facts: [\"对象: Pod/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v\", \"Namespace: aiops-case-05\", \"节点: node2 (Successfully assigned)\", \"错误事件: Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox (重复多次，最近 6m14s 起)\", \"错误事件: Warning NoNetworkFound (重复多次)\", \"具体错误: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)\", \"缺失资源: network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \\\"unavailable-network\\\"\", \"组件: plugin type=\\\"multus\\\" name=\\\"multus-cni-network\\\"\"]\nmissing: [\"Pod 的其他容器日志或状态详情\", \"当前 namespace 下实际存在的 network-attachment-definitions 列表\"]", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/7c4cf6ab5188476b-g1/tools/005-evidence-kubectl_events.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/7c4cf6ab5188476b-g1/tools/005-evidence-kubectl_events.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/7c4cf6ab5188476b-g1/tools/005-evidence-kubectl_events.summary.