data: {"id": "7c4cf6ab5188476b-thinking-parallel_evidence-2197", "run_id": "7c4cf6ab5188476b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实（本轮结论）\n\n### 支持的证据\n1. **Metrics (Prometheus)** — 基线查询返回：\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` = 1（当前仍在等待）。\n   - `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}` = 1；Running = 0（Pod 从未进入 Running）。\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0（无重启）。\n   - Pod UID：`b134b5a8-7471-4feb-a975-9fbb0cc4f912`，调度到 `node2`。\n\n2. **Kubernetes describe / yaml** — 确证：\n   - 状态：`phase=Pending`，条件 `ContainersReady=False`，`containerStatus.app.reason=ContainerCreating`。\n   ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788428364613, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

